# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
# The build context of container/Dockerfile: the repository without history, local state, builds and secrets. It
# covers everything .gitignore does (at any depth), so the image holds what a fresh clone holds; keep the two in step.
# The Dockerfile copies container/requirements.txt and the whole tree, and no tracked file matches a line here.
.git
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/logs
**/*.log
**/build
**/build-*
**/*.out
**/out
backups
bench.env
host/enrolled
gateway/policy/fleet.json
vectors/acvp/*.json
endpoints/stm32h573/artifacts/*.hex
endpoints/stm32h573/artifacts/*.bin
endpoints/stm32h573/tfm-aegis-partition/gateway_pk.h
**/identity.json
**/identity.tpm.json
**/*.session
container/REVISION
